Package: transom
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Transom authors <https://github.com/ry-cen/Transom/issues>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxcb1, libvulkan1 | libegl1
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, xdg-utils
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ry-cen/Transom
Description: View and control a Mac running Sill
 Transom shows a Mac's desktop or one of its windows and sends your mouse,
 scroll wheel and keyboard back to the Mac, which runs Sill. The package
 includes private copies of the FFmpeg 9.0 libraries in /usr/lib/transom.
